      <description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The code of these resources is not meant to be modified. It requires good development skills and strong knowledge of widgets. Opendatasoft will encourage to develop your own page if it doesn&amp;rsquo;t suit your needs (and therefor won&amp;rsquo;t provide support if you still try to modified it)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Find &lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/generators/listing-generator/#listing-generator-documentation&#34;&gt;the complete documentation&lt;/a&gt; at the end of this page&lt;/p&gt;</description>
